<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="wa-theme-default wa-palette-default wa-brand-cyan wa-light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="description" content="Interactive examples for the @lgs1920/autocomplete Web Component.">
    <title>@lgs1920/autocomplete · Examples</title>
    {% include "theme-bootstrap.njk" %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/webawesome.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="site-banner" aria-label="Site navigation">
    <div class="site-brand wa-cluster wa-gap-s wa-align-items-center">
        <a id="lgs1920-logo-link" class="site-logo-link" href="https://lgs1920.fr/" aria-label="Visit lgs1920.fr">
            {% include "lgs1920-logo.njk" %}
        </a>
        <span class="site-brand-copy wa-stack wa-gap-2xs">
            <a class="site-title" href="./">autocomplete</a>
            <h4 class="site-version">Version {{ packageVersion }}</h4>
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="site-links">
        <a href="./" aria-current="page">Examples</a>
        <a href="./docs/">Options and API</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/lgs1920/autocomplete">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@lgs1920/autocomplete">npm</a>
    </div>
    {% include "theme-controls.njk" %}
</nav>
<wa-tooltip for="lgs1920-logo-link">Visit lgs1920.fr</wa-tooltip>

<main>
    <header class="page-heading page-heading--hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">@lgs1920/autocomplete · Web Awesome 3</p>
        <h1>Search, choose, keep the real value</h1>
        <p class="intro">Search local data or connect a live API. Keep the selected value your forms need while showing people clear labels, icons, and useful metadata.</p>
        <ul class="intro-features wa-grid wa-gap-m" aria-label="Component features">
            <li><strong>Search</strong><span>Filter local options or query an API. Configure the minimum query length, debounce delay, result limit, and page size; remote callbacks receive an <code>AbortSignal</code> that can cancel stale fetches.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Select</strong><span>Choose one option or several. Place Web Awesome icons or SVG/PNG images before or after each label.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Keep values</strong><span>Submit selected values through forms; read custom option metadata from selection events. Keyboard navigation is built in.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Remember</strong><span>Save recent selections in <code>localStorage</code> by instance id or shared group, and show them again when the query is empty.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="inline-actions">
            <wa-button href="./docs/" appearance="filled" variant="brand">Read the API</wa-button>
            <wa-button href="https://github.com/lgs1920/autocomplete" appearance="outlined" variant="neutral">View source</wa-button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="examples-heading">
        <div class="page-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">Examples</p>
            <h2 id="examples-heading">Try the component</h2>
            <p class="section-intro">Type a few letters, move through results with the arrow keys, and press Enter to select. Each item can keep domain fields alongside its value and label. The city example shows per-instance input styles; the brand example previews standard theme colors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-grid">
            <article class="demo-card">
                <p class="eyebrow">Local options · recent selections · default appearance</p>
                <h3>Find a fruit</h3>
                <lgs1920-autocomplete id="local-autocomplete" label="Fruit" name="fruit" placeholder="Search apple, mango, watermelon…" with-clear>
                    <wa-icon slot="start" name="magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></wa-icon>
                </lgs1920-autocomplete>
                <p class="section-intro">Choose from 30 fruits in English. The last three selections are saved in this browser and shown when the field is empty. With recent suggestions open, activate the chevron to show every fruit; it points up while the full list is open. The field uses the component's default size and appearance, with the active theme's standard colors.</p>
                <div class="inline-actions">
                    <wa-button appearance="outlined" size="s" data-clear="#local-autocomplete">Clear selection</wa-button>
                </div>
                <wa-details summary="View response">
                    <pre class="search-result" data-language="JSON" role="status" aria-live="polite"><code id="local-autocomplete-selection">Nothing selected</code></pre>
                </wa-details>
                <wa-button appearance="outlined" size="s" data-dialog="open fruit-example-dialog">View example code</wa-button>
                <wa-dialog id="fruit-example-dialog" class="example-code-dialog" label="Example code: Find a fruit" with-footer>
                    <wa-copy-button slot="header-actions" copy-label="Copy code" success-label="Copied" error-label="Copy failed"></wa-copy-button>
                    <p class="eyebrow">HTML</p>
                    <pre data-language="HTML"><code><span class="token-punctuation">&lt;</span><span class="token-tag">lgs1920-autocomplete</span> <span class="token-attribute">id</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"local-autocomplete"</span> <span class="token-attribute">label</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"Fruit"</span> <span class="token-attribute">name</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"fruit"</span> <span class="token-attribute">with-clear</span><span class="token-punctuation">&gt;</span>
    <span class="token-punctuation">&lt;</span><span class="token-tag">wa-icon</span> <span class="token-attribute">slot</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"start"</span> <span class="token-attribute">name</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"magnifying-glass"</span> <span class="token-attribute">aria-hidden</span>=<span class="token-attribute-value">"true"</span><span class="token-punctuation">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="token-tag">wa-icon</span><span class="token-punctuation">&gt;</span>
<span class="token-punctuation">&lt;/</span><span class="token-tag">lgs1920-autocomplete</span><span class="token-punctuation">&gt;</span></code></pre>
