    <section class="content-card" aria-labelledby="quick-start-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Quick start</p>
        <h2 id="quick-start-heading">Add the field, then provide its options</h2>
        <p>In a bundled project, the HTML declares initial choices with <code>&lt;wa-option&gt;</code> elements. JavaScript appends Lyon through <code>field.options</code>, showing how to update the list in code. It also remembers recent choices and handles selection and form submission.</p>
